resolve-ready (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial public release.
  * Run on Ubuntu 22.04/24.04/26.04 and Debian 12/13 with GTK 4.6 and libadwaita 1.1.
  * Convert H.264, H.265 and AAC footage to DNxHR or ProRes with PCM audio.
  * Verify every output before replacing the temporary file.
  * Keep originals, with optional tar backup and per-batch summaries.
  * Ship a self-contained AppImage with a static LGPL ffmpeg build.

